[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:No Wrong Numbers]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.38]What does 'No wrong numbers' mean? | “无错号”是什么意思？
[00:15.79]Mr.James Scott has a garage in Silbury | 詹姆斯·斯科特先生在锡尔伯里有一个汽车修理部，
[00:19.91]and now he has just bought another garage in Pinhurst. | 最近他又在平赫斯特买下了另一个。
[00:25.60]Pinhurst is only five miles from Silbury, | 平赫斯特离锡尔伯里只有5英里，
[00:29.72]but Mr. Scott cannot get a telephone for his new garage, | 但斯科特先生却不能为他新的修理部弄到一部电话机，
[00:34.57]so he has just bought twelve pigeons. | 所以他买了12只鸽子。
[00:38.96]Yesterday, a pigeon carried the first message from Pinhurst to Silbury. | 昨天，一只鸽子把第一封信从平赫斯特带到锡尔伯里。
[00:45.61]The bird covered the distance in three minutes. | 这只鸟只用了3分钟就飞完了全程。
[00:49.30]Up to now, | 到目前为止，
[00:50.86]Mr.Scott has sent a great many requests for spare parts | 斯科特先生从一个修理部向另一个发送了大量索取备件的信件
[00:56.05]and other urgent messages from one garage to the other. | 和其他紧急的函件。
[01:00.95]In this way, he has begun his own private 'telephone' service. | 就这样，他开始了自己的私人“电话”业务。
